{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，X的文字和感受信息明显更密集，尤其S01、S06、S13，普通观众扫屏时更容易顾不过来；Y的左右分栏和完整句子更容易快速阅读。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X用【】突出每段叙事的关键转折，又用大量与音乐具体时刻对应的感受提示，让情绪变化有层次、有细节，尤其从抗拒、怀念、孤独到逐渐接纳自己的过程，前后联系更充分。Y的完整句子更容易理解人物行为的因果，但部分感受被压缩成概括性标签，音乐细节和心理感受之间的对应关系也弱了一些。综合来看，X更能让观众一边听音乐，一边感受到这是一个具体的人在经历一段连续而复杂的心理变化。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "a34036bc-e221-4f9a-9ab7-d59894493004", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T005646488029Z", "elapsed_seconds": 39.218, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T00:57:25.710675+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "fc15e638b086f6b233053d1a9833ada5f7b13d9e92014c80df1d2c27bb669c76", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatg